WEBVTT

00:00:28.167 --> 00:00:30.434
If you've ever lived
through a natural disaster,

00:00:30.458 --> 00:00:32.476
been bullied or been made redundant,

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:33.851
stand on up.

00:00:33.875 --> 00:00:37.101
If you've ever had a miscarriage,

00:00:37.125 --> 00:00:38.934
if you've ever had an abortion

00:00:38.958 --> 00:00:41.893
or struggled through infertility,

00:00:41.917 --> 00:00:43.518
please stand up.

00:00:43.542 --> 00:00:46.934
Finally, if you, or anyone you love,

00:00:46.958 --> 00:00:50.643
has had to cope
with mental illness, dementia,

00:00:50.667 --> 00:00:53.143
some form of physical impairment,

00:00:53.167 --> 00:00:54.643
or cope with suicide,

00:00:54.667 --> 00:00:57.101
please stand up.

00:00:57.125 --> 00:00:58.976
Look around you.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:04.268
Adversity doesn't discriminate.